ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Payment Verification Specification v1.0 — Hausa
Matsayi: Ƙa'idar ƙira kawai (design-only)
Muhalli: Mainnet ga jama'a; Testnet na cikin gida domin gwaji
Aiki: Ba a aiwatar da migration, canjin code, Storage, ko deployment a wannan mataki ba.
1. Manufar
A tsara hanyoyin karɓar kuɗin sabis guda biyu masu zaman kansu:
Bank transfer — Admin ya tabbatar da karɓar kuɗi daga ingantaccen bayanin ma'amala.
Pi payment — backend ya tabbatar da payment ta tsarin Pi Network da ya dace; ba a amince da abin da browser ya faɗa shi kaɗai ba.
Biyan kuɗi, amincewa da buƙata, da kammala aikin abubuwa ne daban.
2. Ka'idojin da ba za a karya ba
Kada a ɗauki screenshot, transaction reference da mai amfani ya rubuta, ko frontend success message a matsayin hujjar biyan kuɗi.
Kada a yi wa Pi payment alamar confirmed bisa sakon browser kawai.
A tabbatar da adadin kuɗi, currency, mai karɓa, payment/reference ID, service request, da network kafin a tabbatar.
Kada a ba da damar tabbatar da payment sau biyu ko sake amfani da Pi payment ɗaya ga buƙatu da yawa.
Ajiye audit trail na wanda ya yi canji, lokacin canji, tsohon/new status, da dalili.
API secrets da Pi Server API Key ba za su kasance a browser ba.
Mainnet da Testnet su kasance rarrabe a backend, database da storage; kada UI toggle kaɗai ya zama tsaro.
Kada a canza shared authentication core, Supabase Core, Dock Navigation, ko wasu working modules ba tare da audit da izini ba.
3. Hanyar Bank Transfer
Mai nema
Ya zaɓi nau'in sabis da aka ayyana farashinsa.
Backend ya ƙirƙiri buƙata da payment intent/reference na musamman.
UI ya nuna bayanan asusun da aka tabbatar da su daga config na server, tare da adadin da za a biya da currency.
Mai nema zai iya shigar da bank transaction reference da loda rasit idan an buƙata.
Buƙatar ta shiga submitted; biyan kuɗi ya kasance pending_verification.
Admin
Admin mai izini ya buɗe bayanan buƙata da rasit.
Ya duba bayanin ma'amala ta bank statement, bank notification ko wata hanya ta hukuma da ALBUKHR ta amince da ita.
Ya kwatanta adadi, currency, ranar ma'amala, mai karɓa, reference da request ID.
Ya zaɓi confirmed, rejected ko needs_more_evidence, ya rubuta dalili da audit record.
Idan ba a iya tabbatarwa ba, status ya kasance pending; kada a fara aikin da ke buƙatar confirmed payment.
Muhimmi: Rasit da aka loda hujja ce da za a bincika, ba hujjar cewa an karɓi kuɗi kai tsaye ba. A yi amfani da server-side file validation da private storage.
4. Hanyar Pi Payment
Backend ya ƙirƙiri payment intent da aka danganta da request, farashi da network.
Frontend ya kira Pi SDK bisa documented flow na app ɗin da aka yi rajista.
A matakan onReadyForServerApproval / server approval, backend ya tabbatar da payment ID da bayanan da Pi API ta bayar, ya tabbatar cewa request ɗin da amount/currency/network sun dace, sannan ya yi approval bisa documented Pi flow.
Bayan SDK ya kammala user-side step, frontend ya aika payment ID kawai ko ƙaramin bayanin da ake buƙata zuwa backend.
Backend ya sake tabbatar da payment status ta Pi API kuma ya kammala server-side completion idan Pi flow ɗin da ake amfani da shi ya buƙata.
Sai bayan tabbatarwa daga server ne payment status zai koma confirmed.
A yi idempotency: retries ba za su ƙirƙiri payment biyu ko su ƙirga payment ɗaya sau biyu ba.
A adana Pi payment ID, request ID, network, amount/currency, timestamps, server verification result, da status history; kada a adana secrets a browser.
Ba a kulle cikakken Pi endpoint sequence a wannan takarda ba. Kafin coding, a tabbatar da takamaiman current Pi Developer Documentation, U2A flow, app registration da Mainnet launch requirements. Kada a ƙirƙiri endpoint ko signature bisa zato.
5. Matsayin buƙata da na payment
Request status (misali)
draft → submitted → under_review → approved / revision_requested / rejected → in_progress → completed
Payment status
not_required / unpaid → pending_verification → confirmed
Sauran sakamako: rejected, failed, cancelled, refund_pending, refunded idan policy ta amince.
Kada a haɗa payment status da request status cikin field ɗaya. Request na iya kasancewa under review yayin da payment ke pending; amincewa ba ta nufin an tabbatar da kuɗi.
6. Farashi da currency
A cire saɓani tsakanin farashi tabbatacce (₦35,000 / ₦500,000) da kalmomin “flexible fee”.
A ayyana ko farashi na dindindin ne ko quote ne da Admin ya amince da shi.
Bank transfer na iya amfani da NGN idan haka aka tabbatar a policy.
Pi payment currency/amount dole ne a fayyace a policy da tsarin Pi payment; kada a ɗauka cewa ₦ da Pi suna daidai ko a canza su da farashin kasuwa ba tare da ƙa'ida ba.
A yi amfani da price snapshot a payment intent domin canjin farashi daga baya kada ya sauya tsohuwar buƙata.
7. Bayanai da tsarin database da ake buƙata
Wannan jerin ƙira ne, ba SQL migration ba:
dapp_service_requests: mai nema, Pi user ID daga trusted auth, project name, service type, description, network, request status, timestamps.
dapp_service_payment_intents: request ID, method (bank_transfer / pi), amount, currency, network, unique reference, payment status, created/updated timestamps.
dapp_service_payment_evidence: private storage path, MIME type, size, uploaded by, review status; kada a dogara da filename.
dapp_service_payment_events: immutable event/audit history, actor type/ID, previous/new status, source, reason, timestamps, safe provider reference.
dapp_service_admin_actions: admin decision/action and reason, if not adequately covered by a general audit log.
Kada a ƙirƙiri waɗannan tebura har sai an kammala schema/RLS review, foreign-key plan, naming convention, and idempotency design. Kada a saka secret, full bank credentials, ko unnecessary personal data cikin logs.
8. Storage da rasit
Private bucket; kada rasit ya zama public.
Server-side authorization kafin upload/download.
Iyakance file type da size; duba actual content/signature ba MIME label kawai ba.
Random/server-generated object path; kada user ya zaɓi path mai iko.
Signed URL mai ɗan gajeren lokaci ko server-mediated access.
A fayyace retention/deletion policy da wanda zai iya ganin rasit.
Pi payment ba ya buƙatar bank receipt ta tsohuwa; kada a tilasta loda rasit idan server verification ya wadatar.
9. Izinin Admin
Yi amfani da shared Admin Auth da MFA/AAL2 da aka riga aka tanada; kada a ƙirƙiri login/MFA na biyu.
Server/RPC ya tabbatar da role da AAL2; ɓoye maɓallin UI ba izini ba ne.
Admin ba zai iya tabbatar da bank transfer ba sai ya rubuta dalili da evidence source.
Pi payment status ya fito daga backend verification; Admin na iya duba/reconcile amma bai kamata ya iya ƙirƙirar confirmed status ba tare da tsarin server da audit ba.
Refund/cancellation yana buƙatar policy da izini dabam; kada a ɗauka cewa payment confirmation ya ba da ikon refund.
10. Mainnet/Testnet
Mainnet: buƙatun jama'a da payment na gaske kawai.
Testnet: bayanan gwaji, fake/mock bank evidence, da Pi Test-Pi/approved test flow kawai inda Pi ke goyon bayansa.
Kada a tura real bank credentials, live Pi payment IDs, ko production receipts zuwa Testnet.
Backend ya tabbatar da environment/network; hana cross-network reference reuse.
Ba a buƙatar Testnet public service; ana buƙatar isolated internal QA kafin Mainnet release.
11. Gwaje-gwajen karɓa
Bank transfer
Screenshot/reference na ƙarya ba ya tabbatar da payment.
Adadi ko currency marar daidaito yana ƙin tabbatarwa.
Reference ɗaya ba ya iya amfani da shi ga requests biyu.
Admin mara izini ko ba tare da AAL2 ba ba zai tabbatar ba.
Rasit ba ya samuwa ga wani user ko public URL.
Duplicate click/retry ba ya haifar da duplicate payment event.
Pi payment
Client success message ba ya isa.
Payment ID marar inganci ko wanda ba na request ɗin ba a ƙi shi.
Amount/network/request mismatch a ƙi.
Approval/completion retry yana da idempotency.
Payment da ba a kammala ba ya kasance pending/failed, ba confirmed ba.
Server API Key ba ya bayyana a JS bundle, HTML, logs ko client response.
Tsarin gaba ɗaya
Mainnet request ba ya karanta ko rubuta Testnet data, kuma akasin haka.
Payment confirmation ba ya kunna aikin kai tsaye idan request ba a amince da shi ba.
Request approval ba ya sa payment ya zama confirmed.
Akwai audit trail ga duk canje-canjen status.
12. Abubuwan da sai an tabbatar kafin coding
Live production assets da halin submit ɗin yanzu.
Farashi na ƙarshe da currency na kowanne service type.
Bank verification source da wanda ke da izinin duba shi.
Takamaiman Pi payment flow da endpoints bisa current official docs.
Repo/API architecture: inda trusted backend zai kasance da yadda secrets za su kasance.
Schema/RLS/Storage naming da retention rules.
Admin role + MFA/AAL2 binding.
Refund, duplicate payment, cancellation, dispute da reconciliation policy.
13. Mataki na gaba
Bayan an amince da ƙa'idar ƙira, a yi audit na read-only ga API repository da Pi Developer integration da ake da shi, sannan a tsara migration/API contracts a branch. Kada a yi production deployment ko SQL migration ba tare da izini ba.
14. Iyakokin wannan takarda
Takardar ƙira ce kawai. Ba ta tabbatar da cewa bank transfer ko Pi payment na yanzu yana aiki ba, kuma ba ta maye gurbin Pi Network documentation ko duba na shari'a/kuɗi ba.
